# DIBAY Auth Session + Notification Destination HARD LOCK

**HARD LOCK (2026-08-13).** Full doc: `docs/dibay-auth-session-notification-destination-hard-lock.md`.

## CONTRACT A — LOGIN

`loading` / `recovering` ≠ guest. Push tap holds + `writePendingPushRoute` until `authenticated`. Login sheet only for `terminal_guest` / `corrupt`.

Owner: `resolvePushAuthGate` in `PushRouteListener.tsx`.

## CONTRACT B — NOTIFICATION

Community comment/like: destination `/community/posts/:id` via `buildCommunityPostNotificationPath`. Bell presentation `community_activity` (not System). Legacy `/philife/posts/:uuid` healed at read time.

## DO NOT

- Guest-open login during recovering
- Invent `/philife/posts/:id`
- `community_activity` → System badge
- Timeout auth hacks

